  "properties": {
    "title": "The #1 plugin for QGIS",
    "description": "First ever FOSS4G talk on QuickMapServices, the #1 QGIS plugin. Seriously.\n\nStory of QuickMapServices: its origins, evolution, lessons learned, and the newest powerful features shaping its future. We will explore community growth, technical decisions, unexpected challenges, and key turning points. And finally \u2014 how did this QGIS plugin surpass the incredible milestone of 10,000,000 downloads worldwide? The inside story finally revealed. \ud83d\ude31",
